<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81107" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιαστράπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flash around</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῶς π. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					9.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				4.131a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					22.6
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγγελοι περιαστράπτοντες τοῖς ὅπλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>4 Ma.</u>
					4.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dazzle</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἀνὴρ περιαστράπτεται
				ὑπὸ κάλλους</span>
			<i>is dazzled</i> with beauty, <i><span class="en">
				Junc.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.50.95
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.220
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
